<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>Render Filters Samples</h1>

<table class="sampletable">

<tr><td class="samplenote">
A string filter. The <tt>OnRenderFilter</tt> handler wraps the panel's rendered HTML in a
highlighted box with <tt>setFilterText</tt>.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TPanel OnRenderFilter="wrapInBox">
  Hello <b>world</b>. This is the panel's own content.
</com:TPanel>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
A DOM filter. The handler reads the DOM with <tt>getFilterDOM</tt>, walks every element
with <tt>walkElements</tt>, and adds a red outline to each. The DOM is serialized back to
HTML automatically.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TPanel OnRenderFilter="outlineElements">
  <span>one</span> <span>two</span> <span>three</span>
</com:TPanel>
</td></tr>

</table>

</com:TContent>
